# QuantumD private local state and generated evidence
#
# Keep the sanitized example fixture at
# examples/quantum_kernel/evidence/evidence.json tracked. The patterns below
# exclude generated runtime subdirectories without hiding source code under
# src/quantumd/evidence/ or the intentional example fixture.

# Local environment and credential files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

# Project-local signing identity and trust state
**/.quantumd/

# Generated evidence graph artifacts
**/evidence/runs/
**/evidence/executions/
**/evidence/keys/
**/evidence/plans/
**/evidence/approvals/
**/evidence/submissions/
**/evidence/results/
**/evidence/authorizations/
